    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a backgrounder regarding the recent Supreme Court ruling on Chevron deference. Can you give me a quick breakdown of the main arguments for and against it? I also need to know how valid the primary concerns are for both the side that wants it overturned and the side that wants to keep it in place.",
